{"id": "unknown-2026-09-26-001", "date": "2026-09-26", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 9, "week": 39, "weekday": "Sat"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Chinese province moves grid-side batteries into spot market", "content": "<p>China’s Zhejiang province has set market rules for 40 grid-side storage projects totaling 2.54 GW/5.1 GWh, with full price-and-quantity bidding planned for 2027. </p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/09/26/chinese-province-moves-grid-side-batteries-into-spot-market/\">Chinese province moves grid-side batteries into spot market</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com\">pv magazine Global</a>.</p>\n", "sources": [{"name": "pv_magazine", "url": "https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/09/26/chinese-province-moves-grid-side-batteries-into-spot-market/", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-09-26-002", "date": "2026-09-26", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 9, "week": 39, "weekday": "Sat"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["installation_demand", "industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": ["increase", "slow"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "PV system costs increase by 7% in Brazil in H1", "content": "<p>Average PV system prices in Brazil rose 7% in the first half of 2026, driven by higher equipment costs, while larger systems continued to offer lower per-watt prices.<br />\nThe increase came as distributed generation slowed, residential installations gained market share, and the use of financing fell to its lowest level in the period analyzed.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/09/26/pv-system-costs-increase-7-percent-brazil-h1/\">PV system costs increase by 7% in Brazil", "sources": [{"name": "pv_magazine", "url": "https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/09/26/pv-system-costs-increase-7-percent-brazil-h1/", "type": "rss"}]}
